<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND 193 FOR ONE VS NEW ZEALAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 193 FOR ONE VS NEW ZEALAND.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>England, chasing a New Zealand</p>
<p>first innings total of 390, were 193 for one wicket at lunch on</p>
<p>the third day of the first test on Sunday.</p>
<p>New Zealand</p>
<p>First innings 390</p>
<p>England</p>
<p>First innings (overnight 123-1)</p>
<p> N.Knight lbw b Doull			  5</p>
<p> M.Atherton not out			   79</p>
<p> A.Stewart not out			   104</p>
<p>   Extras (lb-4, nb-1)			 5</p>
<p>    Total (for one wicket)		 193</p>
<p>Fall of wicket: 1-18.</p>
<p>To bat: Nasser Hussain, Graham Thorpe, John Crawley, Craig</p>
<p>White, Dominic Cork, Darren Gough, Phil Tufnell, Alan Mullally.</p>
<p>Bowling: D.Morrison 13-4-42-0 (nb-1), S.Doull 19-6-50-0</p>
<p>(nb-1), C.Cairns 10-1-50-0, N.Astle 4-1-8-0, J.Vaughan</p>
<p>11-1-29-0, D.Patel 11-5-10-0.</p>
